{"4787590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Touch Grass", "steam_appid": 4787590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2068, almost all computer processing power is taken by the infamous government-company 'The Corporation'. Your aim is to reach their HQ, steal their cutting-edge tech and distribute it to return gaming to its former glory. Go fast. If caught they will neutralize you. To help is the A.P.E. (advanced parkour exoskeleton) allowing you to become a lightning-fast parkour pro, but also exposing your biggest weaknesses...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Fast to Go Fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel faster you also simultaneously charge up special abilities (shown in the top bar). Letting you slam, dash and leap more frequently, boosting speed further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Momentum</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every chained slide in a row maximum possible speed increases, though go too slow and the bonus will be completely lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Shortcuts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every neighborhood has numerous secret routes waiting to be found, find them and you'll be guaranteed to outrun 'The Corporation'. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you come closer to finding 'The Corporation', there is no shame in competing against others for the best time in each stage, claim the world record and grow your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=680 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A Sprawling Voxel City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From industrial zones to shanty towns, travel through all areas of your city to reach The Corporation's HQ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       </p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2068, almost all computer processing power is taken by the infamous government-company 'The Corporation'. Your aim is to reach their HQ, steal their cutting-edge tech and distribute it to return gaming to its former glory. Go fast. If caught they will neutralize you. To help is the A.P.E. (advanced parkour exoskeleton) allowing you to become a lightning-fast parkour pro, but also exposing your biggest weaknesses...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/e316eea1ec8a58811077a3980caf4e08.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Fast to Go Fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel faster you also simultaneously charge up special abilities (shown in the top bar). Letting you slam, dash and leap more frequently, boosting speed further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Momentum</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every chained slide in a row maximum possible speed increases, though go too slow and the bonus will be completely lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/61b477e0d7ef1e74564696be7c3b58c2.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Shortcuts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every neighborhood has numerous secret routes waiting to be found, find them and you'll be guaranteed to outrun 'The Corporation'. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you come closer to finding 'The Corporation', there is no shame in competing against others for the best time in each stage, claim the world record and grow your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.poster.avif?t=1784446121\" width=680 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.webm?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/extras/a75d310187ba30cfbedd6dee7bb3e87f.mp4?t=1784446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A Sprawling Voxel City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From industrial zones to shanty towns, travel through all areas of your city to reach The Corporation's HQ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       </p>", "short_description": "Equipped with a high-tech exoskeleton, attempt to save gaming in this first-person parkour platformer. Jump, wall-run and slide to build momentum. The faster you go, the more special abilities you can use. Set faster times and remember, Don't Touch Grass.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/bb349428c311901b5e6843c32f12b1b4c797063a/header.jpg?t=1784446121", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/f2deeb968f0a883102ea4eb576a26a000a468897/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784446121", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787590/f2deeb968f0a883102ea4eb576a26a000a468897/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784446121", "website": "https://donttouchgrass.carrd.co", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core from roughly 2018+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 or relatively good integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> All these are estimates based of the current build - they many change</li></ul>", "recommended